From: FunKey OS maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] scripts/dtc: remove duplicate yylloc definition

GCC 10 and later default to -fno-common. The parser already defines yylloc
and dtc-parser.tab.h declares it, so the lexer must not define it again.
Update the shipped lexer too because this kernel uses pregenerated sources.

Upstream: e33a814e772cdc36436c8c188d8c42d019fda639

diff --git a/scripts/dtc/dtc-lexer.l b/scripts/dtc/dtc-lexer.l
--- a/scripts/dtc/dtc-lexer.l
+++ b/scripts/dtc/dtc-lexer.l
@@ -41,2 +41 @@
-YYLTYPE yylloc;
 extern bool treesource_error;
diff --git a/scripts/dtc/dtc-lexer.lex.c_shipped b/scripts/dtc/dtc-lexer.lex.c_shipped
--- a/scripts/dtc/dtc-lexer.lex.c_shipped
+++ b/scripts/dtc/dtc-lexer.lex.c_shipped
@@ -634,2 +634 @@
-YYLTYPE yylloc;
 extern bool treesource_error;
